copy-deck.txt
.DS_Store

# SQLite dataset must NEVER land in the website repo (fix #13, 15 Aug 2026). It is ~113MB and
# rewritten nightly; git keeps every version forever, so a single accidental commit would bloat
# the repo permanently and Netlify would redeploy it each publish. The -wal/-shm sidecars matter
# as much as the .db itself — a copy without them can be silently missing recent transactions.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
tools/
.azariya_passphrase
_Install AutoPush.command
Source Clips/
_Pause AutoPush.command
